:: OC Kazu Unexpected Friends with Felix [nobr]

/* Intro */
Walking over to where everyone is waiting for the buses to arrive to take them home, you come across a rather curious sight. <span style="Color: Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>, the bad boy delinquent, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>, the definition of a rule follower. They seem to be sitting on one of the benches chatting away. They both even seem to be… smiling?</span> The sight of this combo getting along is too much for your curiosity to withstand and you find yourself walking over and greeting the boys. <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Felix",
		State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "OC Kazu",
		State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
			Mouth: "Smirk",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Frown",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hello, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$FelixNickname</span>!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> says, waving to you. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sup dork.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> says with a smirk. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> chuckles and playfully shoves <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span>, telling him to be nice. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? He likes being called dork! Just look at him!”</span> As they have a bit of a back and forth, you question how they could possibly be friends, considering how different they are. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I can’t help if I’m this likeable!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> says leaning back as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> rolls his eyes. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We have a lot in common, actually, since we are both more new to this country.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> explains, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Plus, he is not so bad once you get to know him. But a little rough around the edges.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> gasps like he is offended before playfully shoving <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> off the bench. The French boy falls to the dirt, and you almost worry <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> may have gone too far, <span style="Color: LightGreen">but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> quickly leaps to his feet and returns fire with a shove of his own. The two boys roughhouse for a while and you quickly realize that they may not be so different after all, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> is just better at acting good and proper at school.</span> <br>
<br>
After their rough housing is called out by a teacher, the three of you find yourselves sitting on the bench chatting as you wait for the late buses. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t really have to take the buses, if I didn’t want to.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> explains with a smirk, as if he has some special secret, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m staying with my aunt and she’s Vice Principal. So, she could just take me home, but then again, she’s here so late even walking would probably be faster. Just one of the many perks of having family here.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Probably the only reason you haven’t been expelled yet.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I swear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Randolph</span> is going to break your butt with how hard he is hitting you!”</span> He laughs as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> raises an eyebrow. <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Felix",
		State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
			Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Tired",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "OC Kazu",
		State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
			Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Mad",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shit, that geezer WISHES he could break this butt. Would probably give him the best night he’s had in DECADES!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> laughs a little too loudly at his own joke as you roll your eyes. <span style="Color: Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>, on the other hand, doesn’t seem to understand and you have to explain what <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“break your butt”</span> references in English. He then finds it funny, if not a bit gross.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightGreen">By the end, you feel closer to both boys and understand how these lads from different sides of the world would have something to bond over. It’s pretty cute actually.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Kazu" 5 1>>
<<socialChange "Felix" 5>>
<<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Kazu: Unexpected Friendship")>>
<<set $CompletedQuests.push("Kazu: Unexpected Friendship")>>
